{"status":"success","record_count":6,"v_name":"FHL和合本","version":"unv","proc":0,"record":[{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":23,"sec":1,"bible_text":"（大衛的<WAH09001><WH01732>詩<WH04210>。）耶和華<WH03068>是我的牧者<WH07462><WTH8802>，我必不<WAH03808>致缺乏<WH02637><WTH8799>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":23,"sec":2,"bible_text":"他使我躺臥<WH07257><WTH8686>在青<WH01877>草地上<WAH09002><WH04999>，領我<WH05095><WTH8762>在<WAH05921>可安歇<WH04496>的水<WH04325>邊。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":23,"sec":3,"bible_text":"他使我的靈魂<WH05315>甦醒<WH07725><WTH8787>，為<WAH09001><WAH04616>自己的名<WH08034>引導我走<WH05148><WTH8686>義<WH06664>路<WAH09002><WH04570>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":23,"sec":4,"bible_text":"{<WAH03588>}我雖然<WAH01571>行<WH03212><WTH8799>過死蔭<WH06757>的幽谷<WAH09002><WH01516>，也不<WAH03808>怕<WH03372><WTH8799>遭害<WH07451>，因為<WAH03588>你<WAH0859>與我同在<WAH05978>；你的杖<WH07626>，你的竿<WH04938>，都<WAH01992>安慰我<WH05162><WTH8762>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":23,"sec":5,"bible_text":"在我敵人<WH06887><WTH8802>面前<WAH05048>，你為我<WAH09001><WH06440>擺設<WH06186><WTH8799>筵席<WH07979>；你用油<WAH09002><WH08081>膏了<WH01878><WTH8765>我的頭<WH07218>，使我的福杯<WH03563>滿溢<WH07310>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":23,"sec":6,"bible_text":"我一<WAH03605>生<WH02416>一世<WH03117>必有<WAH0389>恩惠<WH02896>慈愛<WH02617>隨著我<WH07291><WTH8799>；我且要住<WH03427><WTH8804>在耶和華<WH03068>的殿中<WAH09002><WH01004>，直到永遠<WAH09001><WH0753><WH03117>。"}],"prev":{"chineses":"詩","engs":"Ps","chap":22,"sec":31},"next":{"chineses":"詩","engs":"Ps","chap":24,"sec":1}}